{
  "name": "Glance - Container Status Endpoint (Portainer -> Glance custom-api)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Glance Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        250,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "glance/containers",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "headerAuth"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        490,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e7447165-b754-49bd-ad7f-921ccc554fdd",
              "name": "portainerHost",
              "value": "10.0.0.62:9443",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fcdd73f1-9567-44d4-8e95-bf50c14c8dc8",
              "name": "endpointId",
              "value": "1",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "List Containers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        730,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://{{ $('Config').first().json.portainerHost }}/api/endpoints/{{ $('Config').first().json.endpointId }}/docker/containers/json?all=true",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Build Glance Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        970,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const containers = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(c => c.Id).map(c => ({\n  name: (c.Names?.[0] || c.Id.slice(0, 12)).replace(/^\\//, ''),\n  state: c.State,\n  status: c.Status,\n  image: c.Image,\n}));\ncontainers.sort((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name));\nreturn [{ json: {\n  total: containers.length,\n  running: containers.filter(c => c.state === 'running').length,\n  containers,\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Note 69f2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Why it changed\nGlance has **no push API** — it *pulls*. This workflow is now an endpoint Glance polls.\n\n## Setup\n1. **Config**: `portainerHost`, `endpointId`.\n2. **List Containers**: Header Auth credential `X-API-Key` = Portainer access token.\n3. **Glance Webhook**: Header Auth credential `X-Glance-Key` = random secret.\n4. Add to glance.yml:\n```yaml\n- type: custom-api\n  title: Containers\n  cache: 2m\n  url: https://service.example.com/webhook/glance/containers\n  headers:\n    X-Glance-Key: ${N8N_GLANCE_KEY}\n  template: |\n    <p>{{ .JSON.Int \"running\" }} / {{ .JSON.Int \"total\" }} running</p>\n    <ul class=\"list\">{{ range .JSON.Array \"containers\" }}\n      <li>{{ .String \"name\" }} — {{ .String \"state\" }}</li>{{ end }}\n    </ul>\n```",
        "width": 960,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Glance Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List Containers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List Containers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Glance Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
